{
  "info": {
    "name": "eCommerce by EBIM · API v1",
    "description": "Colección GENERADA desde la tabla de rutas de la API (`scripts/integrations/generate-api-kit.ts`). Contrato: `docs/integrations/CONTRATO_INTEGRACION_v1.md`.\n\n1. Importa también el entorno `eCommerce-QAS` y llena `clientId` y `clientSecret`.\n2. Envía **0 · Inicio › pedir token**.\n3. Prueba el resto. Los lotes van con `dry_run=true` (simulación); desmarca el parámetro para aplicar.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "// Toda escritura exige Idempotency-Key: una distinta en cada envío.",
          "// Para probar un reintento, pon la cabecera a mano con un valor fijo.",
          "if (pm.request.method === \"POST\" && !pm.request.url.toString().includes(\"/oauth/token\") && !pm.request.headers.has(\"Idempotency-Key\")) {",
          "  pm.request.headers.add({ key: \"Idempotency-Key\", value: \"pm-\" + Date.now() + \"-\" + Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 10) });",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0 · Inicio",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /v1/oauth/token — pedir token",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base}}/v1/oauth/token",
              "host": [
                "{{base}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "oauth",
                "token"
              ]
            },
            "description": "OAuth 2.0 `client_credentials`. Guarda el token en `{{token}}` (script de Post-response). Dura una hora: si otra petición da 401, vuelve a enviar esta.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"grant_type\": \"client_credentials\",\n  \"client_id\": \"{{clientId}}\",\n  \"client_secret\": \"{{clientSecret}}\",\n  \"scope\": \"{{scopes}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"token emitido\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.environment.set(\"token\", pm.response.json().access_token);",
                  "console.log(\"scopes concedidos:\", pm.response.json().scope);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /v1/openapi.json — contrato",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base}}/v1/openapi.json",
              "host": [
                "{{base}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "openapi.json"
              ]
            },
            "description": "El contrato OpenAPI, público y sin token."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
